{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bfIrPIbq4r1794439533.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>加息預期升溫，美元匯價上升，現貨金價跌穿每盎司4,000美元。</p><p></p><p>紐約期金收市報4,000.5美元一盎司，跌29.7美元，跌幅百分之0.7。</p><p></p><p>現貨金價曾跌至3,982.73美元，跌50.1美元，跌幅百分之1.2。</p><p></p><p>美國日前公布較預期強勁的通脹數據，令市場預期聯儲局在下月可能加息半厘，利淡無利息回報的黃金。加息預期升溫亦推高美元匯價，令以美元計價的黃金變得昂貴，推低金價。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:06:44.577307+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T17:17:38.070864+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T23:59:52.001717+00:00","content_hash":"9d892e3b0216a2151980502b80827cfdbd4d97d7ff8a0e0d4b2a3551a4067525","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:06:44.577307+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}